sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Creator
    participant App as Web app
    participant I as IPFS
    participant M as NFTMarketplace
    actor B as Buyer
    C->>App: Image, name, price, description
    App->>I: Pin image
    I-->>App: Image URL
    App->>I: Pin metadata JSON
    I-->>App: Metadata URL
    App->>M: createToken(url, price) + listing fee
    M-->>M: Mint token, hold it in escrow
    B->>App: Click "Buy now"
    App->>M: createMarketSale(id) + price
    M-->>C: Pays sale price
    M-->>M: Forwards listing fee to operator
    M-->>B: Transfers token ownership
